  "title": "When to refer primary care Genetic Testing",
  "summary": "Refer when you see multi-system symptoms with no unifying diagnosis, early onset or family clustering, developmental or cognitive concerns, refractory or sero-negative presentations, or progressive neurologic features. Referral takes ~1 minute; eligible patients receive a no-cost, at-home saliva test and genetic counseling.",
